{
  "_readme": [
    "Series registry for the portfolio library.",
    "Two jobs: (1) group individual volumes under their series shelf, and",
    "(2) merge the different ways the same book gets typed into one book.",
    "",
    "Matching order: a book title is normalized (author + parenthetical removed,",
    "lowercased), then each series' `match` patterns are tried, then each volume's",
    "`aliases`. A standalone volume title like 'Neverseen' still lands on its series",
    "shelf because it is listed as an alias.",
    "",
    "Authors are deliberately NOT stored here — the author shown is whatever the",
    "student wrote in their journal entry. This file only decides shelving.",
    "Add a series when a student starts one; unmatched books become standalone."
  ],
